referenceFunction.generalComment:
Inventory for 1 MJ heat from biomethane, burned in a cogeneration unit with a capacity of 300 kWth. The multioutput process "biomethane, burned in cogen 300kWth delivers the coproducts "heat, at cogen 300kWth, biomethane, allocation exergy" and "electricity, at cogen 300kWth, biomethane, allocation exergy". The energy efficiency is 38% for electricity and 49% for heat. The economic factor is 0.72 for electricity and 0.28 for heat. This leads to the allocation factor of 0.66 for electricity and 0.34 for heat.;
Synonyms: Strom, ab BHKW 300kWth, Biogas, aufbereitet, ökonomische Allokation; 
UUID: a0edd725-ced9-3cab-8932-d03806bdf84b
